# Prisma & Better-Auth

- `Session.token` must stay `@unique`.
- Add `@@map("table_name")` when DB tables are lowercase (User → `user`, Session → `session`, etc.).
- After schema changes: `pnpm db:push` → `pnpm db:generate` → full `next dev` restart (delete `.next/` if odd).
- Verify schema with `@postgres` MCP before suggesting migrations.
- `src/proxy.ts` must not import Prisma; use REST session fetch via `@better-fetch/fetch`.
- Auth models need `createdAt` / `updatedAt` when columns exist in DB.
